{"content":[{"c":["DESTINY"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Pagan god (Meni) mentioned in connection with another pagan god (Gad); presumably a deity of good luck or fortune (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.65.11","r":"Isa.65.11","rawR":"Isa.65.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.65.11","value":"Isa.65.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 65:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Foreordination of the Hebrews as God’s elect people (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.19.5-6","r":"Exod.19.5-6","rawR":"Exod.19.5-6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.19.5-6","value":"Exod.19.5-6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 19:5-6"},"). In the NT eternal destiny depends upon one’s relationship with Christ (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.17.30-31","r":"Acts.17.30-31","rawR":"Acts.17.30-31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.17.30-31","value":"Acts.17.30-31"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 17:30-31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Jn.5.1-5","r":"1Jn.5.1-5","rawR":"1Jn.5.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Jn.5.1-5","value":"1Jn.5.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Jn 5:1-5"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ElectElection_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ElectElection_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ElectElection_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Elect, Election"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Foreordination_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Foreordination_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Foreordination_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Foreordination"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Destiny","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Is 65:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.65.11","rawQueryValue":"Isa.65.11","sourceRefExact":"Isa.65.11"},{"anchorText":"Ex 19:5-6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.19.5-6","rawQueryVal